## 31. `PointerEvent` + `setPointerCapture` – Natív Drag Gesture

A jelenlegi touch drag implementáció (sidebar swipe) kiváltható a Pointer Events API-val, amely **egységes egér/toll/ujj kezelést** ad és pontosabb mint a TouchEvent:[7]

```javascript
// Sidebar drag – Pointer Events API (egységes iOS/iPadOS/desktop)
class NativeDragGesture {
  constructor(el, onDrag, onEnd) {
    this.el = el;
    this.onDrag = onDrag;
    this.onEnd = onEnd;
    this.startX = 0;
    this.active = false;

    el.addEventListener('pointerdown', this.start.bind(this));
    el.addEventListener('pointermove', this.move.bind(this));
    el.addEventListener('pointerup', this.end.bind(this));
    el.addEventListener('pointercancel', this.end.bind(this));
  }

  start(e) {
    this.el.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); // Natív capture
    this.startX = e.clientX;
    this.active = true;
  }

  move(e) {
    if (!this.active) return;
    const dx = e.clientX - this.startX;
    this.onDrag(dx, e);
  }

  end(e) {
    if (!this.active) return;
    this.active = false;
    const dx = e.clientX - this.startX;
    this.onEnd(dx, e);
  }
}

// Sidebar alkalmazás
const sidebarDrag = new NativeDragGesture(
  document.getElementById('sidebar'),
  (dx) => {
    if (sbOpen && dx < 0) {
      const pct = Math.max(dx / window.innerWidth, -1);
      sidebar.style.transform = `translateX(${pct * 100}%)`;
    }
  },
  (dx) => {
    sidebar.style.transform = '';
    if (dx < -60 && sbOpen) closeSB();
  }
);
```

